<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 1.2 POINTS TO 764.8 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 1.2 POINTS TO 764.8 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 1.2 points, or 0.16 percent, on Friday to 764.8, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the banking index losing the most, down 6.8 points, or 0.74 percent, to 916 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
